    "已归类照片当前被隐藏，可在整理设置中重新显示。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filed photos are hidden. You can show them again in review settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已归类照片当前被隐藏，可在整理设置中重新显示。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已歸類照片目前已隱藏，可在整理設定中重新顯示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "若照片权限为部分访问，请在系统设置中允许更多照片。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If photo access is limited, allow more photos in System Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若照片权限为部分访问，请在系统设置中允许更多照片。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若照片權限為部分存取，請在系統設定中允許更多照片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
